# LATCH Secrets & Live LLM

## Secrets

- Store only in gitignored `.env` / `.dev.vars`.
- Never commit, log, or echo API keys.
- Rotate keys that appeared in chat after the event.

## AgentRouter (mandatory)

- Base URL **only** `https://agentrouter.org/v1` (also `AGENT_ROUTER_BASE=https://agentrouter.org`).
- **Forbidden:** `co.agentrouter.org`, `api.openai.com`, `api.anthropic.com` as fallbacks.
- Model prefer: `deepseek-v4-flash`; `max_tokens >= 4096` for JSON drafts.
- Cursor Cloud: `AGENT_ROUTER_HTTP_PROXY=socks5h://127.0.0.1:9050` (Tor). Use `socks5h` (DNS via proxy).
- Production (Vercel/etc.): key + base URL only — do **not** set localhost Tor proxy.
- Force-load gitignored `.env` so stale process env cannot win.
- Fail closed: AgentRouter failure → clear error; **never** invent LLM prose.

## Tor triage

| Code | Symptom | Action |
| --- | --- | --- |
| A | Aliyun WAF HTML on direct | Start Tor; retry via SOCKS |
| B | SOCKS timeout / 9050 down | Restart Tor; wait Bootstrapped 100% |
| C | `unauthorized_client` on Tor AND direct | Off-repo: mint new token; do not fake success |
| D | Invalid API key | Paste correct key into `.env` |
| E | Empty/truncated JSON | Raise max_tokens; fail closed |

Smoke: `npm run smoke:agentrouter` → only `{"ok":true,"model":"…","status":200}`.
